  "question": "What was the specific aggregate dollar value of the shares Amy E. Hood sold under her Rule 10b5-1 trading plan during the fiscal year ended June 30, 2026?",
  "why_unanswerable": "The passage only discloses the adoption of the trading plan, its duration, the earliest date for the first trade (September 14, 2026), and the maximum number of shares authorized for sale. It does not report any actual sales that occurred during the fiscal year ended June 30, 2026, nor does it provide the market price or total dollar value of any transactions, as the first trade was scheduled to occur after the end of that fiscal year."
